<title>USA: Clinton, Perry, Christopher to make statement.</title>
<headline>Clinton, Perry, Christopher to make statement.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton will make a statement at 10:30 a.m. EST (1530 GMT) on Friday, accompanied by Defence Secretary William Perry and Secretary of State Warren Christopher, White House officials said.</p>
<p>The officials gave no further details, but the statement is believed likely to concern U.S. troops and events in Bosnia and Zaire.</p>
</text>
